  description: '1 "Aroma" monster + 1 Plant monster

    While your LP are higher
    than your opponent''s, Plant monsters you control cannot be destroyed by your
    opponent''s card effects. Once per turn: You can pay 2000 LP; banish cards on
    the field equal to the number of "Humid Winds", "Dried Winds", and "Blessed Winds"
    you control. Once per turn, if you gain LP, even during the Damage Step: You
    can make all Plant monsters you currently control gain ATK equal to the LP gained,
    until the end of this turn.'
